## Input

```mlk
// The project keyword applied to type arguments: a project is not a type, and there is nothing
// for an argument written at it to be applied to. In a path of names what the arguments make of
// the path is what a reader is told about; a type and a body are told about what they wrote.

fun handle(value: project[Int].Handle): project[String].Handle =
    project[Bool].data.start-app(value)

```

